{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"C4-02","example":{"issue":{"title":"調撥期間切換，駕駛能否清楚判讀？","intro":"調撥與非調撥期間的車道功能不同，需要明確且一致的引導。","images":[{"key":"results:c4-02-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c4-02-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c4-02-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"entry","title":"調撥起點與進入提示不清楚","text":"不熟悉路況的駕駛可能誤入車道，甚至產生逆向風險。"},{"id":"information","title":"告示資訊不易快速理解","text":"大量依賴文字告示，駕駛不易掌握調撥車道的使用方式。"},{"id":"signals","title":"車道與路口號誌需分清楚","text":"燈面對應、設置距離及轉換清道方式，都會影響駕駛判斷。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[134,135]},"assets":{"results:c4-02-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C4-02/C4-02_現況圖_01.png","width":1740,"height":2164,"label":"C4-02 現況圖","scenario":"C4-02","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":134,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image154.png","sha256":"2ed7346c8ca6f35530925e0971ceea5b69c857f3ea03138f5d40ca07c21968ff"},"results:c4-02-photo-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C4-02/C4-02_現況照片_01.png","width":1543,"height":1139,"label":"C4-02 現況照片","scenario":"C4-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sha256":"6945a7659365a5f6549e2e02d46f9a400241cb4f56840ac8d5ab0fd30f8fc642","source":{"file":"C4-02_user-photos.json","sha256":"dfc21da447eaff961065e3e35c8015a3fa1e452e6b9fe6155091587a4bf9d530","type":"user-attachments","receivedDate":"2026-10-31"}},"results:c4-02-photo-2":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C4-02/C4-02_現況照片_02.png","width":1401,"height":822,"label":"C4-02 現況照片 2","scenario":"C4-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sha256":"964ea5f8e8babb000eb59c6a5a3aa0b613e2236cb1ca850cc50b54efa674b4d1","source":{"file":"C4-02_user-photos.json","sha256":"dfc21da447eaff961065e3e35c8015a3fa1e452e6b9fe6155091587a4bf9d530","type":"user-attachments","receivedDate":"2026-10-31"}}}}
